---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /remote-help/
title: Remote computer help anywhere in the UK
description: Fast remote computer support using Splashtop SOS or TeamViewer QuickSupport. From £25 for 30 minutes. Based in Eastbourne, helping anywhere in the UK.
---
{%- set formProblem = "Remote help" %}
<section class="hero hero-service">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Remote help</p>
      <h1>Fixed over the internet. <span class="line2">No visit needed.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Many problems don't need a home visit. With your permission, I connect to your screen, fix the problem while you watch and explain what I did. Works anywhere in the UK.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}" class="btn btn-primary">Call {{ site.phone }} first</a>
        <a href="#download" class="btn btn-accent">Download the app</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="chips"><li>{{ prices.remote30 | gbp }} for up to 30 mins</li><li>{{ prices.remote60 | gbp }} for up to an hour</li><li>You can end the session at any time</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2>Three simple steps</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span class="step-num">1</span><h3>Ring me first</h3><p>Call or WhatsApp {{ site.phone }} so I know it's you and can agree a time and price.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-num">2</span><h3>Open the app</h3><p>Download one of the apps below and open it. It will show a short code on screen.</p></li>
      <li><span class="step-num">3</span><h3>Read me the code</h3><p>Once you accept, I can see your screen and get to work. Close the app and I'm disconnected.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" id="download" aria-labelledby="download-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="download-heading">Download the remote help app</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">Use Splashtop SOS unless I ask you to use TeamViewer. Nothing is installed permanently, and nobody can connect without a code you give them.</p>
    {%- for tool in remote.tools %}
    <div class="tool-card{% if tool.primary %} primary{% endif %}">
      <h3>{{ tool.name }}{% if tool.primary %} <span class="small">(recommended)</span>{% endif %}</h3>
      <p>{{ tool.summary }}</p>
      <div class="platforms">
        {%- for p in tool.platforms %}
        <div class="platform">
          <strong>{{ p.label }}</strong>
          {% if p.url %}<a href="{{ p.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Download for {{ p.label }}</a>{% else %}<span>{{ p.hint }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="callout callout-urgent">
      <h2 class="h3">Stay safe: only share a code with someone you called</h2>
      <p>Never read a remote access code to anyone who phoned, emailed or messaged you out of the blue, even if they say they're from your bank, Microsoft, BT or me. I will never contact you unexpectedly asking to connect. If in doubt, hang up and call {{ site.phone }}.</p>
      <p><a href="/been-scammed/">What to do if you think you've been scammed</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/pricing.njk" %}
{% include "partials/booking.njk" %}
